{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>במרמה</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other: ויענו בני יעקב וגו' במרמה. Because he came to his father במרמה, his sons came במרמה." "<b>ברכתך</b> Two times in the Masorah: ויקח ברכתך. על עמך ברכתך סלה. For from this blessing came to his sons blessing, selah."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:12.932211331Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}